        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"One Action\" aria-label=\"One Action\">1</span></p><p><em>You unexpectedly strike at your target’s weak point, dizzying your target and creating an opening for your next attack.</em></p><p>Make an unarmed or improvised weapon attack against the Cognitive defense of a target of your size or smaller. On a hit or graze, the target also becomes <strong>Surprised</strong> until the end of your next turn.</p>",
            "chat": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"One Action\" aria-label=\"One Action\">1</span></p><p>Make an unarmed or improvised weapon attack vs. Cognitive. On a hit or graze, the target is <strong>Surprised</strong>.</p>",
